🏘️ Community Problem Reporting Web Application
📌 Overview

The Community Problem Reporting Web Application is a web-based system that allows community members to report local issues such as road damage, water shortages, electricity problems, and waste management concerns.
The goal of this project is to provide a simple, accessible digital tool that encourages community participation and helps decision-makers understand real problems on the ground.

This project is designed as a real-world civic technology application and is developed step by step, starting from a simple client-side version and evolving into a full-featured system.

🎯 Objectives

Enable citizens to easily report community problems

Create a transparent system for viewing reported issues

Practice building dynamic web applications

Serve as a foundation for future full-stack development

