⚙️ Core Features

Community problem reporting form

Problem categories (road, water, electricity, waste, etc.)

Input validation to prevent empty submissions

Dynamic display of reported issues

Clean and user-friendly interface

🔄 How the Application Works (Workflow)

The user opens the application in a web browser

The user fills in:

Name

Problem type

Description of the issue

JavaScript validates the input fields

If validation passes, the report is displayed dynamically on the page

The form resets and is ready for the next report

📋 Requirements to Run the Project

A computer (Windows, macOS, or Linux)

A modern web browser

No internet connection required (for the basic version)

No backend or database required (Phase 1)

🧪 Testing & Validation

Empty fields are blocked using input validation

Multiple reports can be submitted consecutively

Dynamic updates occur without page reload

🚀 Future Enhancements (Roadmap)

